      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00378",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“嗯，当果然。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Yes, exactly as I thought.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00378",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "我姐姐以前也得过跟你一样的病，治了好久都不好。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "My older sister once had the same illness as you, and even after treating it for a long time, she did not get better.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00378",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "但是传给客人之后，她就立刻好起来了。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "But after she passed it on to a customer, she got well right away.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
